  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning Facilitator Tunisia 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this specific project is to help organize and facilitate the reflexive monitoring and learning process for PADEO Tunisia via a learning facilitator. The continuous learning will ensure adaptability and the possibility to work in a complex change environment, such as the envisioned systems change needed to create job opportunities for youth in the agri-food sector in Tunisia. The overall purpose of PADEO in Tunisia is to co-create (with local stakeholders) a coordinated &amp; coherent approach for Dutch development assistance (vision, strategy, action plan) geared to boost youth employment in the agri-food sector of Tunisia.The learning facilitator will guide the reflexive monitoring process.</narrative>
  </description>
